4. EXISTING SYSTEM
Existing weather services commonly provide temperature, forecast charts, maps, radar information, and other detailed meteorological information. However, users who only need a quick interpretation may have to examine several values before deciding what action to take. Some applications also require account creation, mobile installation, or additional services.
The proposed academic project focuses on a lightweight interface with the most relevant weather values and a simple recommendation layer.
