12.2 Limitations
•	The application requires an internet connection for live weather data.
•	The recommendation engine is rule-based rather than a trained machine-learning model.
•	Weather information depends on the availability and accuracy of the external API.
•	Browser location requires user permission.
•	The basic application does not store historical weather data.
