14. CONCLUSION
AI Weather Wise demonstrates how modern web technologies can be combined with public weather services to create a useful weather information application. The project successfully retrieves weather data, presents current conditions and a seven-day forecast, and provides simple smart recommendations based on the retrieved values.
The project is suitable as an academic demonstration of HTML, CSS, JavaScript, API integration, JSON data processing, browser geolocation, responsive design, and rule-based decision logic. The system can be extended in the future with machine learning, historical data, notifications, and additional environmental information.
